Run C<markdown-mkdocs build> in a documented repository.
C<serve> starts MkDocs preview; C<pages> builds and commits to gh-pages locally.
Only C<pages --push> pushes, using origin unless --remote is supplied.
Use --branch to select another publication branch. Failures exit nonzero.

=cut
